Nil fever rigors dysuria cough D  
Pt stoic downplays sx repeats "dont want to be a bother" needed direct Qs re severity  

PMHx  
Insulin dep DM long standing exact duration not clarified today  
Last HbA1c "7‑something" a few mths ago (no result in our system)  
Says eye kidney nerve checks usually fine  
Uses SMBG + blood ketone meter  
Nil recent severe hypos carries hypo tx  
Coeliac dx yrs ago GF diet stable  

Meds (as recalled)  
Insulin glargine ~20u nocte  
Rapid acting insulin with meals + correction (details not fully clarified)  
Nil other regular meds reported  
NKDA per pt  

Allergies  
NKDA  

FHx  
Not explored this consult  

SHx  
Lives with husband indep ADLs  
FT office admin mostly sedentary  
Nil smoker rare ETOH drives metro location good access to care  

O/E  
Gen alert orientated looks mildly unwell but not toxic stoic  
Vitals BP 128/78 HR 92 reg RR 16 Temp 36.8 SpO2 99% RA  
Mucous membranes slightly dry nil obvious ketotic breath  
HS dual nil murmur periph perf good  
Chest clear nil ↑WOB nil Kussmaul  
Abdo soft NT no guarding  
Neuro GCS 15 speech normal gait normal  

Ix today  
POC BSL 18.3  
POC blood ketones 1.8  
Urine dip +++ glucose trace ketones nitrite neg leucs neg  

Assessment  
1 Impending DKA risk  insulin dep DM with hyperglycaemia and ↑blood ketones 1.8  mild dehydration only haemodynamically stable nil abdo pain nil V nil Kussmaul nil AMS  does not currently meet DKA criteria but in high risk sick day window  
Likely 2° relative insulin deficiency from ↓rapid insulin last 2/7 +/- early viral illness  nil clear infective focus O/E today  
2 Insulin dep DM ?T1 chronic overall control appears reasonable per pt but recent 24h suboptimal  need records for HbA1c trend  
3 Coeliac disease stable GF diet  

Red flags screened  
Nil abdo pain persistent V SOB Kussmaul confusion hypotension CP at present  

Plan  
Acute today  
Discussed seriousness of ↑ketones risk of DKA sick day rules reinforced  
In rooms gave extra rapid acting insulin per her correction scale  NovoRapid 4u s/c documented in EMR  pt familiar with regimen  
Encouraged oral fluids sugar free regularly  

Observed in waiting room ~35min  
Repeat BSL by nurse 15.9 ketones 1.3 pt feels similar but not worse tolerating water  

Safety net  
Advised immediate ED / 000 if  
• V develops or cant keep fluids down  
• ↑abdo pain rapid breathing drowsiness confusion  
• Ketones ≥3.0 or >1.5 persisting >4h despite extra insulin  
• Feels "much worse" even if unsure  emphasised not a bother DKA life threatening  
Also generic advice return if fever >38.5 severe SOB CP confusion  

Pathology ordered today (non urgent but done same day if poss)  
UEC CMP  
FBC CRP  
HbA1c  
Lipids  
Urine ACR if not done in last 12/12 (no records visible)  

Chronic dz / f/u  
Need longer DM r/v 30min in 1–2/52 to  
• Clarify basal bolus regimen in detail adjust if needed  
• R/v SMBG ketone pattern  
• Foot check BP lipids renal eye checks thyroid etc  
• Coeliac f/u dietitian if needed  
Will request diabetes clinic letters last HbA1c retinal screen  

Education  
Reassured that coming in for ketones appropriate not overreacting  
Explained ketones due to relative insulin lack + intercurrent illness not gluten free bread  
Brief discussion workplace support hypo mgmt  

Meds today  
NovoRapid 4u s/c in clinic  no new scripts today  

Follow up  
GP phone f/u later today or tomorrow am re BSL ketone trend sx  
Book long DM + coeliac r/v 1–2/52  
RTC earlier if concerns  

Billing  
Standard consult item 23 bulk billed  

